---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy">
  <section>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 prose prose-slate prose-headings:font-display prose-headings:text-brand-blue">
      <h1>Catalyst Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>This Privacy Policy describes how your personal information is collected, used, and shared when you visit <a href="https://catalyst-advisors.com">catalyst-advisors.com</a> (the "Site").</p>

      <h2>Personal information we collect</h2>
      <p>We collect Device Information using technologies including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Cookies</strong> — data files placed on your device that often include an anonymous unique identifier. For more information about cookies and how to disable them, visit <a href="http://www.allaboutcookies.org">allaboutcookies.org</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Log files</strong> — track actions occurring on the Site and collect data including your IP address, browser type, internet service provider, referring/exit pages, and date/time stamps.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Additionally, when you contact us through the Site, we will collect information that you provide directly, including your name, organization, email address, and phone number. We refer to this as "Contact Information."</p>
      <p>When we talk about "Personal Information" in this policy, we are talking about both Device Information and Contact Information.</p>

      <h2>How we use your personal information</h2>
      <p>We use Contact Information strictly to communicate with you.</p>
      <p>We use Device Information to help us understand the individuals and organizations interested in our work, and to improve and optimize the Site.</p>

      <h2>Sharing your personal information</h2>
      <p>We will not share your Personal Information with third parties unless we receive your explicit permission to do so.</p>
      <p>We use Google Analytics to help us understand how visitors use the Site — learn more at <a href="https://www.google.com/intl/en/policies/privacy/">Google's privacy policy</a> and opt out at <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout">Google Analytics Opt-out</a>.</p>
      <p>We may also share Personal Information to comply with applicable laws, respond to lawful requests, or protect our rights.</p>

      <h2>Do not track</h2>
      <p>We do not alter our Site's data collection and use practices when we see a Do Not Track signal from your browser.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>If you are a European resident, you have the right to access personal information we hold about you and to ask that it be corrected, updated, or deleted. Contact us to exercise this right.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For more information about our privacy practices, questions, or complaints, email <a href="mailto:info@catalyst-advisors.com">info@catalyst-advisors.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
